  "content": "\n\n<h1><img src=\"https://cdn-raw.modrinth.com/data/6uJCfiCH/0b4983e0ba8cac6ffe2cc5c2076a8a6b0b28fd1f.png\" alt=\"Spooklementary_logo\" width=\"60\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; Spooklementary</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/discord-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=rgb(210, 106, 6)&label=join&labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&color=rgb(210, 106, 6)\">\n</a>\n&nbsp;\n<img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/iris, optifine, oculus | 1.7.10 to Latest-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=SUPPORTS&labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&color=rgb(210, 106, 6)\">\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=rgb(210, 106, 6)&label=SUPPORT&labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&color=rgb(210, 106, 6)&link=https://patreon.com/spaceagle17\">\n</a></p>\n<h2>什么是 Spooklementary？</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Spooklementary 由 SpacEagle17 制作，是基于 EminGT 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.complementary.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders</a> 的改版。</li>\n<li>这是一款恐怖主题的着色包（Shaderpack），能将你的游戏画面转变为充满氛围与惊悚感的体验。</li>\n<li>非常适合万圣节或恐怖地图！点击页面顶部的“Gallery”（画廊）查看截图。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>重要提示：使用此附加组件时，请勿向 Emin 报告任何问题，请直接在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 上向我反馈。</strong></p>\n<h2>相关链接</h2>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7f94a4d0b4854a694e1b3dbb5aa8e42fc15bce89.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n    <br><br>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>加入 SpacEagle17 的 <strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Discord</ins></a></strong> 服务器进行讨论、提问和提供建议……</li>\n<li>在 <strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/SpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Twitter/X</ins></a></strong> 上关注 SpacEagle17，获取着色包的最新动态。</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:655px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CndrX1R5boQ\" width=\"455\" height=\"384\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></div>\n<h2>赞助商：Ember Host</h2>\n<p>正在寻找价格实惠且可靠的 Minecraft 服务器托管服务？Ember Host 提供极高的性价比与顶级的技术支持！</p>\n<p>点击横幅或在结账时使用优惠码 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EUPHORIA</a></strong>，首单可享 <strong>10%</strong> 折扣。此外，您的消费金额的 <strong>70%</strong> 将直接支持 Euphoria Patches！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/545bcc6a4800cae3bace3a58a06e0dab9eccf9e4_0.webp\"></a></p>",
